  "body": "## Change and scope\n\nFreestanding `#840`-style priced obstruction under [#1898](https://github.com/CrocSwap/integer-mult-bounds/pull/1898) at `(b,a,x)=(38,2,2)`. Names a **fifth** dirt-legal readout alphabet at `Q=8` beyond same-walk / dirty-shadow / partitioned dual / one-repeat / two-repeat / shared-dirt: **three-repeat** (excess-3) layers on partitioned independent duals.\n\n| Dual schedule | Valid | Covering pairs | Undercuts 436? |\n|---|---:|---:|---|\n| Three-repeat `(2,6)` | 930 | **0** | **no** |\n| Three-repeat `(3,5)` | 0 | **0** | **no** |\n| Three-repeat `(4,4)` | 0 | **0** | **no** |\n\nExact covering census is empty on every shape (span/coset bounds; `{d:4}` never restores; excess 3 impossible on L4), so there is no covering `R` and no undercut of the six-query endpoint.\n\n**Scoped obstruction / priced alphabet; no new kappa.** Leave-alone through [#2867](https://github.com/CrocSwap/integer-mult-bounds/pull/2867) / [#2861](https://github.com/CrocSwap/integer-mult-bounds/pull/2861) / [#2860](https://github.com/CrocSwap/integer-mult-bounds/pull/2860) / [#2858](https://github.com/CrocSwap/integer-mult-bounds/pull/2858) / [#2851](https://github.com/CrocSwap/integer-mult-bounds/pull/2851) was not reopened.\n\n## Result\n\nPackage: `research/independent-walks-threerepeat-8q/`.\nTip: `0aa5cf439fdf210a455b78b46b16b3c92ca38f87`.\n\nExact: covering **0** on `(2,6)`/`(3,5)`/`(4,4)`; no undercut of 436.\n\n## Validation\n\n```sh\npython3.12 -I -B research/independent-walks-threerepeat-8q/verify.py\npython3.12 -I -O -B research/independent-walks-threerepeat-8q/verify.py\npython3.12 -I -B research/independent-walks-threerepeat-8q/independent.py\npython3.12 -I -B research/independent-walks-threerepeat-8q/test_package.py\npython3.12 -B scripts/research_package.py --package research/independent-walks-threerepeat-8q\n```\n\nExpected:\n\n```text\nPASS_INDEPENDENT_WALKS_THREEREPEAT_8Q_OBSTRUCTION covering_26=0 covering_35=0 covering_44=0 ... no_undercut_436 no_new_kappa\nPASS_INDEPENDENT_WALKS_THREEREPEAT_8Q covering_26=0 covering_35=0 ... no_undercut_436 no_new_kappa\nPASS_INDEPENDENT_WALKS_THREEREPEAT_8Q_PACKAGE_TESTS groups=6\nPASS_REGISTERED_RESEARCH_PACKAGE research/independent-walks-threerepeat-8q outcome=completed\n```\n\nDefault verify is read-only. Admission uses `need()`; `-O` also passes.\n\n## Overlap and credit\n\nClosest prior: [#2867](https://github.com/CrocSwap/integer-mult-bounds/pull/2867) (shared-dirt), [#2860](https://github.com/CrocSwap/integer-mult-bounds/pull/2860) (two-repeat), [#2861](https://github.com/CrocSwap/integer-mult-bounds/pull/2861), [#2851](https://github.com/CrocSwap/integer-mult-bounds/pull/2851). Freestanding three-repeat alphabet; no competing open PR at refresh.\n\nCredit the mutable-source / #2867 / #2860 / #2861 / #2851 / PR1898 lineage. Prepared by Wentao Li ([VictorLiwentao](https://github.com/VictorLiwentao), [@Is__Victor](https://x.com/Is__Victor)) with substantial AI assistance, under Apache-2.0.",
